  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro - England Dan & John Foley, \"I'd Really Love to See You Tonight**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Shirtless in Hamburg**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Banter - Writing \"Woke Up New**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Banter - Calculus of Quiet Songs vs. Bangers, Pro vs. Amateur Wrestling**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Describe the Vibe to Matt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Banter - Tuning & Towns**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Lee Ann Womack cover, \"I Hope You Dance\" (first verse)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Banter - Not Posers**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2024-01-26** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 89 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Sax! [1]\n- The uploader crossed the Paso del Norte bridge from Juarez on foot to attend, as part of the Jenny From Thebes tour [1]\n- This was the 2024 \"Sworn to the Effort\" duo tour with just John and Matt, with solo openers Craig Finn and Alicia Bognanno of Bully [1]\n- Uploader found the openers' sets beautiful in the venue's medium-sized room, but regrets not recording them [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2024-01-26**: taped by ∂®∑@Mßøä†; source: iPhone from my wife's old work that IT never collected so it's my phone now [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by EPStuff: [The Mountain Goats at Lowbrow Palace - EPStuff](https://epstuff.org/events/the-mountain-goats-at-lowbrow-palace/) [3]",
